{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1362,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d01568870122ad57609d604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有哪里乱了？\r\n我立刻整理好！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1251d29fb3444b741669bc2497c4fd608afc5c1068b4113aa5e674a86d65e514",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03dc3e20880d5d712002062",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私服点検、お願いしまーっス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80eb82020ececb83d3b014c6a6ab073203d568f3671546bd516f670e7ca4fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2411b7eac97341ca7e62b39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハチマキがあると、\r\n休日もシャキッとできるんス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "566867f3a9ee899def1527ef555a6373cc15eb67651df76506ed3ef288addb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb2397302fbc87bf5d229ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服还是像这样穿整齐时最帅气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e09d20d05215873c4bf08acad4f4182842688da4ee945164d93bec44385374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c8c0fea972142444522fe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这件衣服和大家一起跳舞时，\r\n会有种团结一致的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd92e50f8eb75544ac9a205f859487d8e847a25a6f97dc8ee0a71066535e4cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8576f16746f381cb7011b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是只属于我的决胜服！\r\n唔喔喔，我现在充满干劲～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86bba011db58c8246d016c72a27473ed4d9cebe0ec2dc5c153627922b3d9efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad96f4cb0ad91f9a17612dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太清楚可不可爱，\r\n但我喜欢这件制服！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e66f6b099297915a3679f8d989f755c162f4b2d0a3a3d61ff1c28f41a45aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72cab4b12314f463aa723111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观众都在看着舞台！\r\n必须好好检查衣服有没有穿整齐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b95986caa8a793412ddab8ba4de9e7835ae64d7cb9d86acdeef0ddf38927b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018c1401f72549aac34a708d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有天要与劲敌来场热血认真对决……\r\n这件决胜服包含了这样的梦想！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59e9fd90441ca3265796453ae02a78176ca159417c7748e30bc720a9016603c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221e1d6faad86d352c6ab2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是竞赛、纪律还是度假，\r\n都要有纠察队长的风范！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff72b2b7a454eb37001e8ef82a06eea2139f1a41f31ac69d21dd02e58ca0196",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf679b9acb9c4212404c496c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀！没有绑一字巾，\r\n耳朵很容易垂下来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8fac022ca79848f05b0b13302e11db6bed3bfbf8bcb61efdb08591a4910707",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6a420e7c88b46d34ae8e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，怎么样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "31cb2fc8ebaa5ca3334014b01eaf1b58b53bf5fb28e8b503a4f36e8c384a9d2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:766063acd2c5a49d2be4ace0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有哪里乱了？\r\n我立刻整理好！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1251d29fb3444b741669bc2497c4fd608afc5c1068b4113aa5e674a86d65e514",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b612e32bede4e87b1f84118d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af8e69f7716459e6695e2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一决胜负！？\r\n好！！\r\n接受挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "187eec79d4637155096181a13b2531a0b305ca27cbfa796a09d2740cb3a5fc29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bfe7123bca02f380106e66b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是厉害呢……！\r\n但我还也会更加进步！\r\n来正面对决吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0960c1535f49f7eb4e63d1268b10ea536bd75f6ceb412ad9a35faefbb42a829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0682b9a1a07ab47995b1b7e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！！\r\n我来确认服装仪容！！\r\n发型没问题！服装也没问题！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6becf997f48df98cbcf2aadc9183907e546b3989131f59bd6c5f2bb6cae2315d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbdcfeb76347957957106ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有好好吃早餐吗！？\r\n不可以不吃早餐喔！\r\n一天的开始必须好好补充体力！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e576b1e838c819618b29b3bc87f3c8b34f401eec64a0b3884f83d014371eb38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f0cb7db34f948cfb8581a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当你感到痛苦或难受的时候……\r\n就朝着红色的夕阳奔跑吧！\r\n要超越自己的极限～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d504334a6d353ef90761986066d89dd6df4a766cfc35387b747e8bc665ba3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c846883c295d15397c41c53e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使用食堂时要保持整洁！\r\n用完餐后要把桌子擦干净！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8317de08ad88723a88777bd067119f1ab97c9562997dd1b112936d01dcf8fb02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c932c007c5dfe27ebda7f4c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早睡早起有很多好处喔！\r\n我以前都会跟爸爸比赛\r\n谁能比较早睡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffada86b889f32253f3874ca7a9026c5da1f927a4dabd9e89ea16a4d01eb03aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b021176fb77c03a4df807b76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还在工作吗！？\r\n唔喔喔喔！我不能输给你！\r\n我会学习你的精神！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e73664bf1aac63434821b29d40fee82f0f0e18da0fca8cdd509300cd667f66f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d8f602a5455948f060569f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到新生里可能会有\r\n我未来的劲敌……唔！\r\n我就感到坐立难安！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5d19e8724d093aedbe068f451b929b1f7f57aee26527976351fdda8493964b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625e300ad7ebcf118d6ad16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气热的时候，大家很容易\r\n衣衫不整。我必须成为榜样，\r\n把衣领和袖子都扣好……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0f4585b0b3d3c17e99d09ff14763e185c9490287b0e11b7a1e6807efd1cf34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba4aa52bb6a73751da37969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前去商店街帮忙打扫落叶，\r\n但风实在太强了……在风停下来前，\r\n我经历了漫长的苦战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d816c6e7084f1745063ed8b25c93636ec113642c79c8089125d66af0e9c221cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073f5525afa442d0a09b759b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有什么办法可以让人在雪地上\r\n顺畅地跑步呢！？\r\n不能靠加速冲刺克服吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7543040b8b216c999ae8d34052e1a5ae745cc6e114f36a389830621d899cdf08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa51674867eb96ab864633bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安──！嘿嘿嘿，\r\n或许因为换上了一身全新的打扮吧？\r\n让我觉得早晨的空气也很新鲜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa1df90fd90bc76e82c9e847a498feefd7dd370e252edf4689ec3783ca0d9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20452fb72cac4ec600165c70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为刚起床就呆坐着\r\n什么也不做实在是太浪费了！\r\n要不要和我一起去跑一圈啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3116ed5584de82bfdc1328ca9b0aecd120a9f92f44ab376acd137bb01ef502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98dd53bebdd9f4f278fc677b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔在外面享用午餐也不错呢。\r\n做个大蒜精力便当……\r\n啊！不过气味会危害纪律！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5457cbb4b2a360f535100f407eb9fec9c9d36ebf07c6139449d74c1a64e67d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af1148fb991f2af848ff0083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这天气很适合观光呢！\r\n好，就把今天的巡逻路线\r\n拉得比平时更长一点吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b7957f6928a9a95db1402d689b94b7ea8663908c520cde8e2ce3bf90bf81b96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c026413122595b42fc388872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要玩试胆是没问题，但得慎选地点！\r\n否则会对地主以及居住在那里的幽灵\r\n造成麻烦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb8f9f3f884c36e15151b79562e7443f9e7e702fd76c2dba29760dc3d505aee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b69ea9e69bcca7fa7fb36a07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若晚上要去散步也让我随行！\r\n我会携带手电筒，\r\n采取万全的戒备体制！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea855f7f52bde2434d8a02f0a9370dff9928137b6eb809c1d435093204fb8603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edae2054de91533db36644d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是邂逅崭新事物的季节！\r\n同时也是青春的起点！\r\n或许还会遇见未来的竞争对手呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0138afbef7e18191604cf4fa2622a1f5da39e52704b2cc0427460038c8b97c87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96dbc2c51ba67976a19dbc8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这完全是符合夏季的衣服！\r\n不论要去海边、河边还是去抓\r\n昆虫都非常适合！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30ca95064616ba73ec99fb76a7e89ee03c0baae81c4cdd11fc4df03058d7376",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17aaf42886edd38cc5d87074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多接触时令事物，培养健全的\r\n心灵也属于遵守纪律的一环！\r\n所以要不要去欣赏枫叶呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5871c8161fce10471428a770f0b68b1a70e7f73ff89b63beb9b0d4673cc339d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827c2fcbf9eb4ff5ace1dab7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然身处寒冷的季节，但我的内心\r\n依然暖呼呼！就如腰间的吊饰一样，\r\n全年都「热血」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a9119597bf50b2cddb35fffe96ca5e0d1d31744e40a04d53b0c0b103e7deeb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc90b70f26e1301215e6514e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086716d23d171a0e11fe0fafe5953f29f71625dd67015137bea8ebd7d5345589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fa240a9f6eacc842cbc8607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086716d23d171a0e11fe0fafe5953f29f71625dd67015137bea8ebd7d5345589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6288f3b684f2ba4d385f85f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸是体育老师！！\r\n他热血！正直！！心胸宽大！！\r\n并教会我许多重要的事情！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b706f739731ecd458e82483bfaa5450182fc1ae630980e600e59d47d3977427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc7ea4d7f088b42ea6b3861e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和八重会一起坐禅！\r\n经历严苛的精神修行后，\r\n感觉我跟她变得心意相通了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c1543f77d546261a0490de2bc6aaf79b3e3a5c25c9d269820c27540e08e56e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c9bc4716d52ea471e09876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少年漫画可谓是心灵的圣经！\r\n友情、成长、与劲敌的火热对决！\r\n……唔呜呜，太热血了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a4c9b0be555075c21e568c5682db5f0badd4c11c51ffe2d22b3a3f2eb527eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479f87c139bf39ac5f7ca968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗前辈的跑法既自律又耿直……\r\n我想成为她的劲敌，\r\n堂堂正正地与她对决！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab1faf4126efe5287d62026cbcea7f869f517144ded0bedaa10fb832884315ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb1fddd4884e6bddf4597b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剑道和武术都有教人「残心」\r\n这句话！意思就是、那个……\r\n要不松懈全力冲刺，之类的意思啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7bd9811b8272725fff15b50550ba4586a84290224a8229b3b490c9037975bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428ad5ffdfa0f5ce88b3b107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了避免肚子着凉，\r\n跳舞时要将所有的热情，\r\n尽全力灌注在肚子里！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c635b040f916086259ae641b8caac881818b833feb1fb0d5ac8264d34e474968",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c82350e7525810177bc29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与认真对决过的劲敌们\r\n穿着相同的服装跳舞，\r\n这种认同彼此的感觉很热血呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27434c5c778b3ffa3e26ed4fda0040c810f4f8804839a2a1d49db3ce82d6a9e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16748e9bb325c10654b98fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸和妈妈都称赞过我的决胜服！！\r\n嘿嘿，不枉我将自己的心意\r\n都灌注在里面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b077c29611d7a434e5e89cedef53b0597f2720b76d8816c77e6e6677c1e5574d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ddce49b84ec211fdaecefc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是特别的服装，\r\n所以我也要拿出特别的表现！\r\n「唔喔喔喔喔喔！」的感觉！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cccceaa99298c72e997faa7f7d6397ebd82612b94fec456e963b9e7ec0e8f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1faaf0807f26ef288490d146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊啊……唔唔，这样不行！！\r\n小手！面！胴！面！小手─！！\r\n我要挥剑唤醒睡迷糊的身体！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a97a30d8cfbd8b79d00fe4cfbaf3c2b4d860c6ede01ca85b9ab3f056425d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f70b6ec6f32ac3caef563c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饭时要细嚼慢咽……！\r\n呜唔……肚子饿的时候，\r\n总是会不小心狼吞虎咽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46511836da8c81325476bd94f6c5799e326a718e1f4b885e963074b66932bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a046fa83be714375eaeacc72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去检查有没有人违反\r\n门禁时间！！\r\n一发现就要立刻抓起来！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1be15dab80af07b869119b7e9ddb2b6f6b08654dcf8b68c1984f6aae5b3ddb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00db629eccf4b2d3f5fd103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一开始是最关键的时期！\r\n就算是新生也必须谨守纪律！！\r\n这样大家一定能度过快乐的生活！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0664a6e78e5601f1e35428fa5b46637cb6cd2c0b513a9bc70ab94b2cf6ad7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffeb25cb5449361ab89d414",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢在夏天跑步！\r\n流完一身汗会感到很畅快！\r\n训练员要不要也来一起跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "841ce20cd796cec35261c157a97fad2e17fe80dccadc9b7f6be61ba0eee782d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218a80b08402d582d9eb1954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天是最适合运动的季节！！\r\n也就是说短暂的秋天是没得休息的！\r\n我要挑战精神和肉体的极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df32e4c8b7b09b38f48b6cac299eaf80b282a0f6901b58da46e7768bb5e3b86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea81ad0d770c537be21e1bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气冷的时候就要用干布摩擦身体！\r\n虽然我小时候在雪中这么做后，\r\n就被妈妈骂了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "412f560a5ee7fca2714efeb57172f2a4d057eb817e533d9e070635a5a7755a5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1147d32722f622927f6f0aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把这副打扮的照片寄回了老家，\r\n听说父亲看见后吓到站不起来……\r\n有那么吃惊吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4af688c28fa6ebf86b3693556c0249625d32321b09efcf589496f157ce7071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780ce682153c7e818c911e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时尚很难懂呢……\r\n像是○○系等等的……\r\n简直跟备考一样是强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33dce45d3b37dd14411eb5e6d953637ab4c606ed1b8eb56e677e36b4ebca22fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa6089b5956e047beeca160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚见到了八重，\r\n但她却一时认不出我来，\r\n装扮的影响力实在很惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff89ecae210014e4fd0726ee004774ea77edc4152d1a3c3d2fbbb20b26d0f7aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c52a439b144d6fc899f2dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先前城市和佐敦约我一起去\r\n服饰店……但我感觉自己被她们\r\n当成了换装洋娃娃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c1ccd44a09f21baa13b77a78b1ee8ceffb8dc5ef07e54f857cc9d7f005f0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4414d6f2332d2ae6b9b84e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳说的话有时候很难理解呢……\r\n不过没关系，只要用心沟通\r\n就轻松多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e183f1281a7649d7491578154fee72dfb748e2998d1d89e3394af117a7986a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6713bb74f4cb4300c9795c50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在旅行时，四处游山玩水\r\n也很不错……但到头来，\r\n不论去哪里都会忍不住想跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec64f784df60b5b3327d36218e0582765880baf57f9819f42f2f3da23c1ad4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4bd593158aaf60d549a24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以慰劳众纠察队员的烤肉大会\r\n实在很棒。不仅整顿心灵\r\n也整顿了纪律！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be494ca549158a7750d855db64bb1182af3e3e466249c574980994768521ce20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2fd30cdc765001a272fa55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "施放烟火前要仔细阅读\r\n使用说明！还必须准备好\r\n用来灭火的水！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc3d93b2370b1510f6db19ff5419d4f4e876d628be5484892f378a78e36eac4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb20885ee7024f0d9822a2d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到赏花，总是会有人不小心\r\n玩得太忘我，打乱了纪律呢。\r\n所以巡逻是不可或缺的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "182d04278482db25f3d15234a94d00cf40c66edb28028d780f648fb1286fe66c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4c4bd6de11e06c82cf34e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我里面穿着泳装。这样\r\n想游泳时就能随时去游泳池，\r\n非常方便！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51735604dd08378fa58be6f146cd1d1111aa5b50a00da34aa29f4c5755eba714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:215efc322397ed846e234296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说时值食欲大开的秋天，\r\n但吃太多肚子会凸出来……\r\n穿这件衣服就能警惕自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda2f3eea20db5e430b78c6aede334c6e510581cf069405c95805ea39bbc298d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e163287c83d8654f109536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪时穿凉鞋能让脚趾\r\n感受冰冷，藉此绷紧神经！\r\n还能磨练心志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7415058c4d4ee2cf61e58d0598d846a4710efd459601b5cd5a162802401bfd8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b399d4c1f0682a482e7788c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟平常的模样差好多……\r\n这样感觉不是便衣警车，\r\n而是便衣纠察队员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58957ed7b263b1de865b0a381e2e8472fe260034b7abf52d009a0c938ac67be7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cff64e7f7b053dd54e2e8b43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种锵锵锵的撞击声，莫～名\r\n让我有种似曾相识的感觉……原来\r\n以前旅行时买过类似的剑的钥匙圈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17bccc3057500ff195e2874b01024bc627c30bf4296d3b8822ae8b609f9de7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6dbc179bba9bc05a49d372b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！！\r\n今天也请多指教了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6056e44797a9e7004b16c9096604b035ff4e7663512fdb5a42976dd0baaccf13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d29adee70e620fac1fc5841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ッシャー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5beb9223340ea055f6ebd4cca204c677bed8fc08abeeb59bc962a1c7439e926",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:680933c25ac969c0c9691866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高耸的难关……严格的训练……\r\n努力、汗水、泪水……唔～！！\r\n我准备好了！！真是热血沸腾啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c49c247cc118f326c9a274e117e659c6133b57d318e5b689a8c4feaf2639db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:031ade21e0e0b17c482d25dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么训练我都不怕！！\r\n我会正面挑战它！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d293410802f25b5767c6fc91f8c24b48f3acce6031a6770b46bfa8c3471402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dee2ba9983516f49dfc3188",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是身体，连精神也要锻炼！\r\n这才是真正的训练！！\r\n我说的没错吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c05ef7c03fd044b266a3c56ddcfb9e987bd676014f289fce0c03733f53fd49f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a533ca19f01677c0476c7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员设计的训练项目，\r\n我一定会全部完成的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3ea86b98e7b5af82390992b8b2807d383595e95606bafc72fff4b4aa05e842c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5664eae204d1eb3ec8cbf420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为训练很辛苦，\r\n所以才有努力的价值！\r\n请严厉地锻炼我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80a894fb57f9bf6a2f270e71236f6452f2e21f83456c57f2e1f36c0b98cea1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff202bb60faf8853d0791931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸很严格，但也很温柔。\r\n和训练员一起训练时，\r\n我偶尔会想起他！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dcf929dca42c38396f2555c8849d8320df75f5deab10b2dfb807dbfc7da6e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e30335f300dceb415c2a823",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到集训，就是严格的特训……！\r\n必须舍弃所有天真的想法！！\r\n即使倒下也要继续特训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da566da1c6e119e42599df7edd8ec8dfa908d818eedaafb0035d9e1490c965f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3d0b2d1cd4c75b49ba7e04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是训练还是竞赛！\r\n都只需要以热血之魂征服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b83d425575429f696367ead8d76c6093508e7f0e649fe3d1951feb8c692cbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e827557c287a06696de360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉鞋的鞋带也扣紧了！\r\n准备完毕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f00f0c468b132f13a92851fa7c17758c3c954042d037b493dd6d7e300ea909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f248167550b6bc35eb5a2658",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要跑到\r\n绑在腰上的衬衫\r\n都随风飘扬为止──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5381a91289a342fb4f5a7aed3a0d20c70ea1848db5bb72b72f40a5d4b12f49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
